"<strong>\"Survival curves are straight lines on a log plot.\"</strong> Only the α part is; the β part bends them down, and the shoulder is what fractionation exploits.",
"<strong>\"OER is a constant {#}.\"</strong> It depends on the dose and the cell line, and it falls off steeply with oxygen pressure only below about {#} mmHg.",
